---
const base = '/vikhram';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50/50 dark:bg-dark-card/30">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center reveal">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6">
        About <span class="text-gradient">Me</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Hello! I'm Vikhram, currently pursuing a dual Master's in
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Nanobiotechnology</strong> at
          <a href="https://www.amrita.edu/school/nanosciences/" target="_blank" class="text-primary dark:text-primary-light hover:underline">ASNSMM</a>
          and
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Immunobiology</strong> at
          <a href="https://immunobiology.arizona.edu/" target="_blank" class="text-primary dark:text-primary-light hover:underline">University of Arizona</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am a quick learner with an interdisciplinary approach towards research. I like optimizing workflows and enhancing productivity by bridging the gap between various fields. My research interests focus on developing targeted immunotherapies using nanocarriers, exploring novel drug delivery systems, and investigating the role of engineered biomaterials in modulating immune responses.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5 mt-8">
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/ravivikhram" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-card flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-primary dark:hover:text-white transition-all duration-200" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <i class="bi bi-linkedin text-lg"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/WeParadox" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-card flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-primary dark:hover:text-white transition-all duration-200" aria-label="GitHub">
          <i class="bi bi-github text-lg"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:vikhram@example.com" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-card flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-primary dark:hover:text-white transition-all duration-200" aria-label="Email">
          <i class="bi bi-envelope text-lg"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
